Package: nflrest
Type: Package
Title: Compute Team Rest Disparities, Schedule Advantages, and Travel Metrics for NFL Games
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Jake", "Baker", email = "47325704+jbaker12@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Interfaces with 'nflverse'/'nflreadr' to compute team rest disparities,
    schedule advantages, and situational travel/rest metrics for NFL games.
    Analytical functions accept plain data frames or tibbles so they can be
    tested offline against static fixtures. This package is a work in progress:
    rest and travel metrics are implemented, while time-zone and composite
    schedule-advantage metrics are planned.
